OL,3,GNEWSABereaved dad meets senior health
OL,4,Abosses over maternity care
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe couple have been critical of the
OL,7,Fcare they received. Their account
OL,8,Fformed part of a review - led by
OL,9,FBaroness Amos and published in June -
OL,10,Fthat raised concerns about the safety
OL,11,Fof women and babies at the trust,
OL,12,Fexternal. It cited heavy staff
OL,13,Fworkloads and staff shortages, with
OL,14,Fpatients said to be consistently
OL,15,Fexperiencing discrimination and
OL,16,Finconsistency in care.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
